[i]Last Updated November 25, 2025:[/i] Here are answers to frequently asked questions about my game, [b][i]All You Need Is Rush[/i][/b]!

[h1]What is [i]All You Need Is Rush[/i] about?[/h1]

[b][i]All You Need Is Rush[/i][/b] is a narrative-focused short experimental incremental game, with gameplay mechanics designed with storytelling in mind. Featuring a stamina managing gameplay inspired by minesweeper.

[h1]Where can I get [i]All You Need Is Rush[/i]?[/h1]

[b][i]All You Need Is Rush[/i][/b] will soon be available on:

[list]
[*][url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/3237840/]Steam[/url]
[/list]

[h1]What are the minimum system requirements?[/h1]

Let's just say if you got a computer more powerful than Steam Deck you'll be running it just fine.

For Steam Deck the game targets 800p/90FPS.

[h1]Does [i]All You Need Is Rush[/i] have PC controller support?[/h1]

Yep.

[h1]Does [i]All You Need Is Rush[/i] support PC cloud saves?[/h1]

Yes it does! You may also find local copies of your saves under [code]Documents/Saved Games/All You Need Is Rush[/code].

[h1]I ran into a technical issue with the game. What should I do?[/h1]

If you need technical support, please have a look in [url={{< ref "/aynir/tech-fixes" >}}]All You Need Is Rush Tech Fixes[/url]. If the problem still hasn't been resolved, you can seek help in [url=https://steamcommunity.com/app/3237840/discussions/1/]All You Need Is Rush Technical Support forum[/url], which should help get you sorted.

[h1]So that’s it for the [i]All You Need Is Rush[/i] FAQ?[/h1]

That’s all of it! Thanks for reading ;)